# TB Antimicrobial Resistance (TB-AMR) Analysis and Decision Support System

Copyright 2025 TB Antimicrobial Resistance (TB-AMR) Project Contributors

This product includes software developed for global health research and
clinical decision support in tuberculosis care.

This software was developed to support:

- Clinical decision-making for tuberculosis treatment
- Global collaboration in TB resistance research
- Data-driven insights for healthcare providers
- Evidence-based treatment recommendations

The project may include components from other open source projects.
Please see the individual source files for attribution details.

For more information about tuberculosis antimicrobial resistance research,
visit: <https://www.who.int/news-room/fact-sheets/detail/tuberculosis>
